<title>PHILIPPINES: Dharmala Q3 net up at 32.525 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>Dharmala Q3 net up at 32.525 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to September 30</p>
<p>			(in million pesos)</p>
<p>    Revenues			 71.750 vs 46.420</p>
<p>    Net income		     32.525 vs 30.824</p>
<p>Note: Full name Dharmala Philippines Inc. The company attributed the rise in net profit to the contribution of its equities and insurance businesses. It specialises in offering insurance for health and educational needs.</p>
<p>- Manila newsroom 63 2 8418938 Fax 8176267</p>
</text>
